list.item:
That the National Constitution of 1886, in incision [paragraph] No. 1 of Article 202, says also that
                        the properties which formerly belonged to the Colombian Union now belong to
                        the Republic;

That by Decree No. 1320, of November 28, 1914, the Executive Power decided
                        that statistics in regard to mining properties should be compiled, and
                        determined the manner in which this should be done;
